WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.826
The chapter records three
places where sources disagree,

2
00:00:03.826 --> 00:00:06.500
so nobody quietly loosens the code later.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.710
The biggest is the type of the Graph
token: the reference page says one thing,

4
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.018
a troubleshooting article says another,

5
00:00:13.018 --> 00:00:15.938
and the module's own source
sides with the reference.

6
00:00:15.938 --> 00:00:20.038
The pipeline passes the safer form
and confirms it in the second lab.

7
00:00:20.038 --> 00:00:23.599
The other two are small: a
trailing slash on the issuer,

8
00:00:23.599 --> 00:00:26.350
and how a pull-request subject is spelled.

9
00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:31.420
The action version and the one preview
feature, which isn't used, are on the slide.
